cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MicroMap in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MicroMap"
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  The open format of MicroMap, Graphomics' microbiome knowledge graph:
  the graph schema (node labels, identifiers, relationship types and
  provenance properties) and a hash-chained decision-log format with a
  reference verifier. Not affiliated with the identically-named MicroMap
  microbiome-metabolism visualization resource (Thiele lab, npj Biofilms
  and Microbiomes, 2025).
authors:
